    "summary": "The famed mixed pho with crispy fried sweet potato, char siu pork, roasted peanuts and a harmonious, multi-layered sweet-and-sour sauce.",
    "story": "Pho chua is the pride of Lang Son, once regarded as a refined dish for entertaining honored guests. Unlike ordinary pho, it skips the hot broth: the rice noodles are tossed with an array of toppings and drizzled with a sweet-and-sour sauce made from vinegar, sugar and secret seasonings — refreshing without ever feeling heavy.",
