    "story": "From Dinh Bang village, homeland of the Ly dynasty, these square cakes wrapped in dong leaves symbolize the bond of husband and wife. The tapioca shell, studded with crunchy strands of papaya and dyed golden with gardenia fruit, is an indispensable offering at Bac Ninh engagement ceremonies.",
